  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Futures: One Economy Foundation&apos;s multi-disciplinary approach to adolescent girls and young women in Namibia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Intergenerational dialogue activity organised meetings with stakeholders to discuss the scope and objectives of the dialogue; facilitate a workshop and training sessions for participants on effective communication and understanding across generations; evaluate the impact of the intergenerational dialogue through feedback sessions and surveys; and document success stories and lessons learnt from the dialogue sessions to inform future activities and improvements.</narrative>
  </description>
